TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts with exchange
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EQUILIBRATE 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -print_frequency 10
    -punch_frequency 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head step cell log_iap_h2g
    10 PUNCH TRANSPORT_STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SI("H2(g)")
END
